  <title>Product / Account relationship</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Reports</gui><gui>Products</gui><gui>Product / Account
  relationship</gui></guiseq> lists every product with its expense, revenue
  and inventory account, to check that each sale and purchase lands in the
  right place.</p>

  <p>Type into <gui>Product</gui>, <gui>Expense</gui>, <gui>Revenue</gui> or
  <gui>Inventory</gui> to narrow the list, for instance to every product
  posting to one revenue account. <gui>Reload</gui> reads the products
  again.</p>

  <p>To correct a product, check <gui>Load product selection in external
  product window</gui> and double click it: it is selected in <link
  xref="products"/>, where it can be edited. Right click a product for its
  <gui>Product hub</gui>.</p>

</page>
